    },
    {
      "id": "profanity_minor_001_clean",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "うん、そのほうが助かる。言い直せるのは、かなり強い。",
      "displayText": "Mm, that helps. Being able to rephrase is actually strong.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
